This build-only repository vendors:

- mesa-patches/ and win32-compat/ from https://github.com/gahingwoo/wddm-mali-g52
  (GPL-2.0; see COPYING). These are Windows portability patches for Mesa
  Panfrost and the related POSIX shims. They are used to compile the manet
  Mesa 26.3 PanVK branch on Windows.
- src/vdrm/ from https://github.com/collegeming/win-panvk-probe, derived
  from Mesa vdrm (MIT) and DroidVM's vdrm_wddm.c (MIT).
- src/mali_kbase_vdrm_win.c (MIT), the kbv RPC transport over vdrm.

No device credentials or private keys are stored here.
